{{rel-top|Cognates}}From the same Proto-Germanic: Low German {{m|nds|Eek}}, Dutch {{m|nl|eik}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|iik}}, English {{m|en|oak}}, Danish {{m|da|eg}}, Swedish {{m|sv|ek}}.
From the same Proto-Indo-European: Latin {{m|la|aesculus||Durmast oak}}, Latvian {{m|lv|ozols}}, Lithuanian {{m|lt|ąžuolas}}, Albanian {{m|sq|enjë||juniper, yew}}.
